# Screen Spacing Rhythm Rule

For every screen layout in this prototype:

- The gap between `title-wrap` and `intro` must always be `12px`.
- The gap between `intro` and the immediate component directly below it must always be `16px`.

Apply this spacing consistently across all screens and mirrored files.
